":"2025-09-22T13:56:28Z"},"body":"These are some minor clarity improvements for the `IsNormalized()` implementations in C# to make them easier to understand.\r\nThese now match the C++ implementations:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0dd9178269e447aca805bc4b4a9a840119c10275/core/math/vector3.h#L523\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0dd9178269e447aca805bc4b4a9a840119c10275/core/math/quaternion.cpp#L74\r\n\r\nIn terms of performance, the differences are minimal. Here's a makeshift benchmark for 1 million iterations:\r\n```\r\nnon-normalized is normalized:\r\nFalse\r\nnormalized is normalized:\r\nTrue\r\nnon-normalized old:\r\n10.6845ms\r\nnon-normalized new:\r\n11.6897ms\r\nnormalized old:\r\n10.7924ms\r\nnormalized new:\r\n9.1759ms\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108974/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108974/timeline","performed_via_gith